## Model card

- **Name:** Claude Fable 5 (Anthropic)
- **Short description:** Anthropic's Claude Fable 5 frontier reasoning model (legacy, succeeded by Claude Fable 5.1/5.2), positioned for demanding reasoning and long-horizon agentic work. Proprietary.
- **Provider / access:** Anthropic Claude API (`claude-fable-5`), Amazon Bedrock, Google Vertex / Claude Models on Google Cloud, Microsoft Foundry, Claude Platform on AWS (per Anthropic docs). OpenRouter lists `anthropic/claude-fable-5`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Released 2026-06-09 (per Anthropic docs). Reliable knowledge cutoff January 2026; training data cutoff January 2026 (per Anthropic docs).
- **IDs:** `claude-fable-5` (Claude API and listed platforms), `anthropic.claude-fable-5` (Bedrock).
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 tokens; max output 128K tokens (per Anthropic docs).
- **Modalities:** Text and image input; text output. Reasoning: adaptive (always on). Tool use supported.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** $10.00 / 1M input tokens, $50.00 / 1M output tokens (per Anthropic docs and OpenRouter); cache and batch pricing available. Paid, premium pricing.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary (parameter count and detailed architecture not publicly disclosed).

